Forge — mixed licensing.

Each top-level directory carries its own LICENSE. Rough map:

  apps/*             → MIT       (apps/*/LICENSE)
  services/mcp/      → MIT       (services/mcp/LICENSE)
  services/api/      → AGPL-3.0  (services/api/LICENSE)
  packages/*         → MIT       (packages/*/LICENSE)
  spec/              → CC0-1.0   (spec/LICENSE)

Contributions to MIT-licensed paths are MIT. Contributions to the AGPL
service require signing the contributor agreement at forge.sh/cla.
